o 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 32 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in August to September and 133% in April to May. Grid 22699 had its driest year in 1988 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
